---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Warehouse & Steel Structure Ceiling Work — ARCLIFT"
  description="Crawler under-ceiling platforms for industrial warehouse ceiling construction, crane rail installation, and steel structure mezzanine work."
  transparentNav={false}
>

  <section class="hero-banner">
    <div class="overline">Warehouse & Factory</div>
    <h1>INDUSTRIAL CEILING CONSTRUCTION</h1>
    <p>High-bay ceiling construction, overhead crane rail installation, mezzanine work, and routine maintenance.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="sec">
    <div style="max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;">
      <h2 style="font-size:28px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:20px;">Industrial Ceiling Projects</h2>
      <p style="font-size:16px;color:#475569;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">Steel-structure warehouses, logistics hubs, and manufacturing plants need ceiling access for panel installation, overhead crane rail mounting, lighting, sprinkler systems, and insulation. These are massive, repetitive installations — ceiling panels measured in thousands of square meters, crane rails spanning hundreds of meters.</p>
      <p style="font-size:16px;color:#475569;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">The FDDPT's pick & carry advantage is decisive here: the platform travels elevated along the full bay length while crews install panels continuously. No stop-lower-reposition-raise cycle. Diesel power handles rough, unpaved factory floors; electric mode takes over inside the finished building.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec sec--gray">
    <div class="sec__header reveal">
      <div class="sec__overline">Recommended Models</div>
      <h2 class="sec__title">FOR WAREHOUSE WORK</h2>
    </div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;">
      <div style="padding:32px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid #f1f5f9;">
        <h3 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;">FDDPT-20M — Compact</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;color:#64748b;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:20px;">Entry model for mid-height warehouses (up to 20m). Lighter, faster repositioning. Good for distribution centers and standard logistics buildings.</p>
        <a href="/products/fddpt-20m-crawler-ceiling-platform/" class="btn btn--outline-blue">View Model →</a>
      </div>
      <div style="padding:32px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid #f1f5f9;">
        <h3 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;">FDDPT-25M — Mid-Range</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;color:#64748b;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:20px;">Sweet spot for most industrial steel structures (15m–25m). Heavy 0.3–3T load handles panel stacks and crane rail sections.</p>
        <a href="/products/fddpt-25m-crawler-ceiling-platform/" class="btn btn--outline-blue">View Model →</a>
      </div>
      <div style="padding:32px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid #f1f5f9;">
        <h3 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;">FDDPT-31M — High-Bay</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;color:#64748b;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:20px;">For tall logistics centers and manufacturing plants (25m+). High-reach with full platform capacity for heavy industrial ceiling components.</p>
        <a href="/products/fddpt-31m-crawler-ceiling-platform/" class="btn btn--outline-blue">View Model →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta">
    <h2>WAREHOUSE CEILING PROJECT STARTING SOON?</h2>
    <p>Get a cost comparison: FDDPT pick & carry vs traditional scaffolding for your bay dimensions.</p>
    <a href="/contact/" class="btn--white">Request a Comparison →</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
